---

<section class="problems">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-label">The problem</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Your data isn't private</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-item">
        <h3>Every prompt is logged</h3>
        <p>Every question you send to ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini is stored and can be reviewed. Your most sensitive thoughts become training data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-item">
        <h3>The provider sees everything</h3>
        <p>Your queries, your context, your documents — all visible to the model provider. You're relying on their promise not to look.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-item">
        <h3>Trust is not a security model</h3>
        <p>Terms of service change. Breaches happen. Without hardware-enforced isolation, "we don't read your data" is just a policy — not a guarantee.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problems {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #555558;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #F5F5F5;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .problem-item {
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .problem-grid > :last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .problem-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #F5F5F5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .problem-item p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .problem-item {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-right: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
      padding-right: 2.5rem;
    }
    .problem-grid > :last-child {
      border-right: none;
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .problems { padding: 5rem 1.25rem; }
    .section-header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .problem-grid { gap: 2rem; }
    .problem-item { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  }
</style>
